---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import Card from '../../components/Card.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Open discussion"
  description="Weekly Open Discussion sessions — Tuesdays 11am to 1pm, in person or via Zoom, hosted by the Swedenborg Centre."
  currentPath="/events"
>
  <main class="container-prose px-6 md:px-8 pt-10 md:pt-14 pb-4">
    <p class="mb-4">
      <a
        href="/events"
        class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-accent-primary no-underline hover:underline"
        >← Events</a
      >
    </p>

    <article class="prose-rnc">
      <div
        class="font-display font-semibold text-eyebrow tracking-eyebrow uppercase text-accent-primary mb-2.5 !mt-0"
      >
        ✦ Tuesdays · 11am–1pm
      </div>
      <h1>Join our Weekly Open Discussion Sessions</h1>
      <p>
        <strong>Tuesdays – 11 am to 1pm – In person or via Zoom</strong><br />
        Hosted by the Swedenborg Centre, 4 Shirley Rd, Roseville
      </p>
      <p>
        You're warmly invited to join our weekly Open Discussion, held on
        Tuesdays.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is an open, friendly conversation where everyone is welcome,
        whether you're new to Swedenborg's writings or have been exploring them
        for many years. There are no formal presentations—just thoughtful
        discussion in a relaxed and respectful atmosphere.
      </p>
      <p>
        Feel free to bring a question, a passage from Swedenborg's writings, or
        a topic that has arisen in your own spiritual journey. Together we
        explore how spiritual teachings can help us better understand ourselves,
        our relationships, and the deeper meaning of everyday life.
      </p>
      <p>
        While Swedenborg's writings provide the foundation for our discussions,
        we also enjoy exploring insights from other wisdom traditions where they
        shed light on similar spiritual themes. Past conversations have included
        topics from Advaita Vedanta, Shin Buddhism, and the Fourth Way teachings
        of G.I. Gurdjieff and P.D. Ouspensky. Looking at timeless spiritual
        questions through different lenses often deepens our understanding and
        appreciation of Swedenborg's teachings.
      </p>
      <p>
        There is no expectation that you have read Swedenborg or are familiar
        with these traditions. Curiosity, thoughtful questions, and a
        willingness to explore are all you need. We would be delighted to
        welcome you and hear your perspective.
      </p>
    </article>

    <Card variant="tint" class="mt-8" title="Zoom link and dates">
      <p class="m-0">
        The Zoom link and dates can be found on the Swedenborg Centre events
        page.
      </p>
      <div slot="footer">
        <Button href="https://swedenborg.com.au/events/">
          swedenborg.com.au/events →
        </Button>
      </div>
    </Card>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
